OL,3,GNEWSADiversion could affect emergency
OL,4,Aaccess, residents fear
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in a small hamlet fear their
OL,7,Flives could be put at risk by a major
OL,8,Froad diversion - as a council says it
OL,9,Fcannot offer an accurate timescale for
OL,10,Fwork to end.
OL,12,FRoadworks to repair a subsided
OL,13,Fcarriageway through Upware, near Ely in
OL,14,FCambridgeshire, began on 17 August with
OL,15,Fan end date expected in June 2028,
OL,16,Faccording to Cambridgeshire County
OL,17,FCouncil's website.
OL,19,FBut locals have described feeling
OL,20,F"marooned" in their own homes due to
OL,21,Froad closures - as well as an
OL,22,F"unsuitable diversion route".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
