OL,3,GNEWSADiversion could affect emergency
OL,4,Aaccess, residents fear
OL,5,
OL,6,FLinda and David Miller say they now
OL,7,Fface a 34-mile (54.7km) round diversion
OL,8,Falong a single, unlined track, that is
OL,9,Fitself festooned with "lumps, bumps and
OL,10,Fhumps".
